### Create a post with mentions to test notification system
POST http://localhost:5000/api/comunidad/posts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "¡Hola @admin y @testuser! ¿Cómo están? Este es un post de prueba para menciones 🚀"
}

### Create a comment with mentions
POST http://localhost:5000/api/comunidad/posts/POST_ID_HERE/comments
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Excelente post @admin! Me encanta esta funcionalidad @testuser",
  "postId": "POST_ID_HERE"
}

### Get notifications to verify mentions were sent
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test multiple mentions in one post
POST http://localhost:5000/api/comunidad/posts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Reunión de equipo: @admin @dev @marketing @support - Por favor confirmen asistencia para mañana a las 10am"
}